---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Jams"
  description="How Jams collects, uses, and protects information when you visit jams.agency or reach out to work with us."
>
  <section class="hero-bg" style="padding: 128px 24px 64px; margin-top: 65px;">
    <div class="hn-container">
      <h1 style="font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 64px); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: #111; max-width: 640px;">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p style="margin-top: 16px; font-size: 16px; color: #888;">Last updated: June 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding: 64px 24px 128px;">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="color: #1A1A1A; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.75;">

      <p style="color: #404040; margin-bottom: 48px;">
        This policy describes how Jams ("we", "us") handles information collected on jams.agency. We keep it short because we don't do much with your data.
      </p>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #111; margin-bottom: 16px;">What we collect</h2>
        <p style="color: #404040; margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong style="color: #1A1A1A; font-weight: 500;">Contact information.</strong> When you fill out the intake form on our start page, we collect your name, email address, and anything you include in your message. We use this only to respond to you and evaluate whether we're a good fit.</p>
        <p style="color: #404040; margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong style="color: #1A1A1A; font-weight: 500;">Analytics data.</strong> We use PostHog and Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site — pages visited, time on site, referral source, and similar behavioral data. This is collected anonymously and used only to improve the site.</p>
        <p style="color: #404040;"><strong style="color: #1A1A1A; font-weight: 500;">Cookies.</strong> Analytics tools set cookies in your browser. You can disable cookies in your browser settings; the site will continue to work without them.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #111; margin-bottom: 16px;">What we don't do</h2>
        <ul style="color: #404040; padding-left: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li style="padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: #F55D11;">—</span> Sell or rent your data to anyone</li>
          <li style="padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: #F55D11;">—</span> Send marketing emails unless you ask us to</li>
          <li style="padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: #F55D11;">—</span> Share your contact details with third parties outside of the services required to run this site</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #111; margin-bottom: 16px;">Third-party services</h2>
        <p style="color: #404040;">We use the following services to operate the site. Each has its own privacy policy.</p>
        <ul style="color: #404040; margin-top: 12px; padding-left: 0; list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
          <li style="padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: #F55D11;">—</span> <strong style="color: #1A1A1A; font-weight: 500;">Vercel</strong> — hosting and edge delivery</li>
          <li style="padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: #F55D11;">—</span> <strong style="color: #1A1A1A; font-weight: 500;">PostHog</strong> — product analytics</li>
          <li style="padding-left: 20px; position: relative;"><span style="position: absolute; left: 0; color: #F55D11;">—</span> <strong style="color: #1A1A1A; font-weight: 500;">Google Analytics</strong> — web analytics</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #111; margin-bottom: 16px;">Data retention</h2>
        <p style="color: #404040;">We retain contact form submissions for as long as the business relationship is active or we have a legitimate reason to keep them. Analytics data is retained per each provider's default retention policy. You can request deletion at any time.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-bottom: 48px;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #111; margin-bottom: 16px;">Your rights</h2>
        <p style="color: #404040;">You can ask us to access, correct, or delete any personal information we hold about you. Email us and we'll respond within 10 business days.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #111; margin-bottom: 16px;">Contact</h2>
        <p style="color: #404040;">Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:j@jams.agency" style="color: #F55D11; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245, 93, 17, 0.3);">j@jams.agency</a>.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
